<description>&lt;p&gt;Mali installed an ex-colonel as president while JNIM claimed an IED attack on a Malian army and Africa Corps vehicle between Sévaré and Konna. In Niger State, armed assailants abducted 14 Islamic school students and a teacher from a farm, and a separate raid took 15 female pupils from another farm. A dynamite explosion occurred when smugglers were transporting the explosives illegally to Burkina Faso. NGOs called for transparency from Malian authorities over the abduction of Mountaga Tall, and the UCDP recorded 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5oT2RKWWJoT2VJVi0xcnlZWXFiMVZtUXVFUmF1VHBXTVZVRGtnQmplWU00XzZVZHJVRmVubWRGY3NEOFlZVnNCVTM5cTczc05CX21QUlg2OHRBY1p1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPT0haaHVoWkttS3BPNVFyWDdPMnhKTjNvSTdBSzhYYlZQbVFpc2FKS3hBLU9nSk8xQUJXM2U1V0JrME5ScXFqZ1JHQW1VMjhrenVlaVlqNlZMQ1g1MzdqWGVhRU9lWW55di14MUY2ajRGZ2lIQ3Z2TlFpODJUeGRkWG9WcmREY1J6bnRHMkM2VTZCT3EwXzgtekE5UGMtVWZHZEFIZlczekU5MUFFbm5nb2xFdmtuOEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;3News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNWXNJRU5kZ2FqaDYzR3RvdXE5MVdCTmMwOXB5Rm9iSUtORU9lWm5iSEVUcDNyaElRTWZpbXdqaVI0ejc1ZGhWZS1lMDJpV0syelR0NU92b0tJU3dvY1RxZ0gyakNnUFlRTkwzZll0NnpCVjdDMDE0c0ZadHYwN2lHYlRMdlRNdi1WRzhoTkx5Nk5XU1dZSGk0NXFWT3B5M0VM?oc=5&quot;&gt;FIJ NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOLVVNVDdNb0RuNjBoajhxTDBXanNjNlhrQXFrSF9GRFBnU0RNS0N2TzJFQnFRRXV1VUtQeDU5N29qbHloX29Kdlp4Tjd4dzJheXVRMFNiMW53S3F3NWV6Y2VzQVJ2QmVzVjhHQ1ppODVDZkpJWHZfZm5lZ0pwS3FJR0dQdkdFc1VSMkZtMHUtaDRILWpES1JyS2lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOUDI5QkZNQl9LTkFIRWdnTEVESDZsb3